{"id":"gui_a","lemma":"guía","pos":"noun","rank":1850,"glosses":["guidebook","directory","permit for transporting certain goods"],"ipa":"/ˈɡia/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"guías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-gu%C3%ADa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él nos hizo de guía.","en":"He acted as our guide.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453399","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"us"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Mi amigo será nuestro guía.","en":"My friend will be our guide.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705445","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"friend"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"our, ours, to us"},null]},{"text":"No te fíes demasiado de tu guía.","en":"Don't rely too much on your guidebook.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806185","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"too much"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Hubo que buscar un guía para el viaje.","en":"It was necessary to find a guide for the trip.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to seek"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"voyage"}]},{"text":"Los perros guías ayudan a la gente ciega.","en":"Guide dogs help blind people.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"dog","l":"perro"},null,{"g":"to help","l":"ayudar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"blind","l":"ciego"}]}]}